{"id": "154857", "name": "דטרמיננטה - 05", "qtype": "truefalse", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 1, "options": {}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\">\n<div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\">\n<p>תהי <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(A\\in M_n(F)\\)</span>.</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ det(AA^t)=det(A^2) \\]</p>\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"native-answer\">[[input:ans]]</div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:12px 16px;margin-bottom:12px\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">מבנה הפתרון:</b> נחשב את שני האגפים בעזרת כפליות הדטרמיננטה ו-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\det(A^t)=\\det(A)\\)</span>.</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 1 — האגף השמאלי</b><br>לפי <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\det(XY)=\\det(X)\\det(Y)\\)</span> ו-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\det(A^t)=\\det(A)\\)</span>:<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\det(AA^t)=\\det(A)\\det(A^t)=\\det(A)^2. \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 2 — האגף הימני</b><br><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\det(A^2)=\\det(A\\cdot A)=\\det(A)\\det(A)=\\det(A)^2. \\]</p>שני האגפים שווים ל-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\det(A)^2\\)</span>.<p style=\"text-align:center\"><b>הטענה נכונה.</b></p></div></div>", "specificfeedback": "[[feedback:prt1]]", "prtcorrect": "", "prtpartiallycorrect": "", "prtincorrect": "", "inputs": [{"name": "ans", "type": "radio", "boxsize": 15, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": false, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": false, "showvalidation": 0, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options":